  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "At Qin Bai Sheng’s auction, bidders discuss a sandalwood sacred elephant egg offered alongside Immortal Gu. A sandalwood sacred elephant is an ancient desolate beast; after it grows to adulthood, it can rival rank seven Gu Immortals. Onlookers say a living ancient desolate beast managed well is like a treasure trove with endless value, and that the tusks of the sacred elephant will grow back even if they are removed. The same auction talk names sacred elephant blood beside those regenerating tusks, and the bid itself is the egg; those are covered on sacred elephant blood and sandalwood sacred elephant egg.",
